  "title": "Broadstone Net Lease, Inc. Announces Public Offering of Common Stock",
  "summary": "VICTOR, N.Y. – Broadstone Net Lease, Inc. (NYSE: BNL), (“BNL”), today announced that it is commencing an underwritten public offering of 11,000,000 shares of its common stock, par value $0.00025 per share, in connection with the forward sale agreements described below. BNL expects to grant the underwriters a 30-day option to purchase up to 1,650,000 […]",
